 "title": "Recording a supplier bill",
 "duration": 74.06,
 "cues": [
  {
   "start": 0.31,
   "end": 8.85,
   "text": "Enter a bill from a supplier, approve it, and see what is due to whom and when.",
   "step": 0,
   "url": "",
   "intro": true
  },
  {
   "start": 8.85,
   "end": 14.59,
   "text": "Payables shows what the mall owes its suppliers, and which bills are overdue.",
   "step": 1,
   "url": "/admin/accounting/payables"
  },
  {
   "start": 14.59,
   "end": 19.11,
   "text": "Choose New bill.",
   "step": 2,
   "url": "/admin/accounting/bills/new"
  },
  {
   "start": 19.11,
   "end": 22.49,
   "text": "Choose the supplier.",
   "step": 3,
   "url": "/admin/accounting/bills/new"
  },
  {
   "start": 22.49,
   "end": 30.58,
   "text": "Type the supplier's own invoice number, so it is never entered twice.",
   "step": 4,
   "url": "/admin/accounting/bills/new"
  },
  {
   "start": 30.58,
   "end": 36.21,
   "text": "On each line, the expense account. Here, cleaning.",
   "step": 5,
   "url": "/admin/accounting/bills/new"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.21,
   "end": 43.24,
   "text": "What it is for.",
   "step": 6,
   "url": "/admin/accounting/bills/new"
  },
  {
   "start": 43.24,
   "end": 47.38,
   "text": "And the amount before VAT.",
   "step": 7,
   "url": "/admin/accounting/bills/new"
  },
  {
   "start": 47.38,
   "end": 52.68,
   "text": "The VAT rate. The office adds the VAT and the total.",
   "step": 8,
   "url": "/admin/accounting/bills/new"
  },
  {
   "start": 52.68,
   "end": 61.97,
   "text": "Save and approve. The bill is posted to the books and waits to be paid by its due date.",
   "step": 9,
   "url": "/admin/accounting/bills/44"
  },
  {
   "start": 61.97,
   "end": 69.01,
   "text": "Bills from a purchase order are created from the order itself, and checked against what was received.",
   "step": 10,
   "url": "/admin/accounting/bills/44"
  }
 ],
